::summary
A video needs a source the page can load.
::

::video[caption="No source at all"]
::

::video[src="http://example.com/a.mp4" caption="Plain http"]
::

::video[src="javascript:alert(1)" alt="A script URL"]
::

::video[src="/media/ok.mp4" poster="/img/ok.jpg" caption="A usable one"]
::
